eeps you from relying on high-interest credit cards when surprise expenses happen. Once that's built, slowly work toward 3–6 months of expenses.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### 5. **Use the \"24-Hour Rule\" for Impulse Purchases**\n","Whenever you’re tempted to buy something non-essential (like new clothes, gadgets, or extra decor), wait 24 hours. \n","* Often, the impulse passes, saving you money effortlessly. If you still want it after a day and it fits your budget, go for it!\n","\n","---\n","\n","### 6. **Tackle High-Interest Debt First**\n","If you have credit card debt, pay more than the minimum whenever possible. \n","* Focus extra payments on the card with the highest interest rate first (the *Avalanche method*) to save the most money, or the card with the smallest balance (the *Snowball method*) for quick motivation.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### 💡 **How can I help you today?**\n","Would you like me to:\n","1. Help you set up a **custom 50/30/20 budget** based on your monthly income?\n","2. Give you ideas on **how to cut down daily expenses**?\n","3. Create a **debt pay-off plan**?\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["income = 30000\n","expenses = 20000\n","savings_goal = 5000\n","\n","prompt = f\"\"\"\n","You are PocketSmart AI, a personal budgeting assistant.\n","\n","User details:\n","Monthly income: ₹{income}\n","Monthly expenses: ₹{expenses}\n","Savings goal: ₹{savings_goal}\n","\n","Calculate:\n","1. Remaining money\n","2. Whether the savings goal is achievable\n","3. Simple ways to reduce expenses\n","4. A practical monthly budget suggestion\n","\n","Give the answer in simple language.\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","response = client.models.generate_content(\n","    model=\"gemini-3.5-flash-lite\",\n","    contents=prompt\n",")\n","\n","print(response.text)"],"metadata":{"id":"x_xBz8YZ1QOl","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1790081900210,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":2840,"user":{"displayName":"BASKARAN G","userId":"15838012765387880751"}},"outputId":"0eb25def-504f-