ntertainment.\n","*   **Savings & Investments (20% - ₹6,000):** Your baseline savings target (you are currently saving ₹10,000, which is amazing!).\n","\n","### 2. 3 Ways to Reduce Expenses\n","Since you are spending ₹20,000 a month, here are three simple ways to trim the fat:\n","1.  **Audit Subscriptions:** Check your bank statements for unused OTT subscriptions, gym memberships, or app fees and cancel them. (Saves ~₹500–₹1,000/month).\n","2.  **Smart Grocery Shopping:** Make a weekly meal plan, shop with a list, and buy store brands to cut down on food waste and impulse buying. (Saves ~₹1,500/month).\n","3.  **Optimize Utilities:** Be mindful of electricity and water usage, and look for energy-efficient habits to lower monthly bills. (Saves ~₹500/month).\n","\n","### 3. Savings Suggestion\n","Since you currently have ₹10,000 left over each month:\n","*   **Automate It:** Set up an automatic transfer of **₹7,000 to ₹8,000** into a separate savings or liquid mutual fund account on the day you get paid. \n","*   Treat your savings like a non-negotiable \"bill\" you pay to your future self. \n","*   Keep the remaining ₹2,000–₹3,000 as a flexible buffer for minor unexpected costs. \n","\n","Keep up the great financial habits! Let me know if you want to adjust any of these numbers.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["print(\"=\" * 45)\n","print(\"       POCKETSMART AI\")\n","print(\"   Smart Budget Assistant\")\n","print(\"=\" * 45)\n","\n","income = float(input(\"Enter monthly income: ₹\"))\n","expenses = float(input(\"Enter monthly expenses: ₹\"))\n","savings_goal = float(input(\"Enter monthly savings goal: ₹\"))\n","\n","print(\"\\n⏳ Analyzing your budget...\\n\")\n","\n","print(pocket_smart_ai(income, expenses, savings_goal))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"3TaDVI1nA96x","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1790082207625,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":16944,"user":{"displayName":"BASKARAN G","userId":"15838012765387880751"}},"ou